  "description": "Generic OpenID Connect credential authenticator for Orleans.Lattice.Membership. Specializes the built-in JWT authenticator with discovery-document-driven JWKS rotation from any conformant OIDC provider (Okta, Auth0, Keycloak, Ping, Google), standard OIDC claim conventions (sub subject, configurable group / role claims), exact-issuer authenticator selection, and fail-closed signature-algorithm pinning taken from the discovery document when it is not configured explicitly. An additive sibling to the Entra authenticator; neither package depends on the other.",
